{"id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md","title":"可表示代入下的对角引理","display":"thm-diagonal-lemma — 可表示代入下的对角引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","aliases":["91-thm-diagonal-lemma","91-thm-fixed-point-lemma"],"display":"thm-diagonal-lemma — 可表示代入下的对角引理","depends_on":["[[91-df-diagonal-function]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-diagonal-lemma</span><span>91-thm-fixed-point-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diagonal-lemma — 可表示代入下的对角引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b31ce2c72a177855\" href=\"?note=b31ce2c72a177855\" title=\"91-df-diagonal-function\">91-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\supseteq\\mathrm Q\">\\(\\mathcal S\\supseteq\\mathrm Q\\)</span> (能表示基本句法函数的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 算术化的可递归语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> (一自由变量公式与句子)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_x\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_x\\)</span> (在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 中可表示的句法代入函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(x)\\,\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta\\!\\left(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}\\right)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(x)\\,\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta\\!\\left(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}\\right)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>构造令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta(x)=\\theta(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(x,x))\">\\(\\delta(x)=\\theta(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(x,x))\\)</span>，再取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi=\\delta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner})\">\\(\\psi=\\delta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner})\\)</span>。句法表示性使\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 证明代入所得编码正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner\\)</span> 是元语言中的 Gödel 数，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}\">\\(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}\\)</span> 才是对象语言中的数码。若\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 含真理谓词，前提还要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 已经算术化该扩展\n语言；“PA”这个名称本身不自动提供任意扩展语言的编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"b31ce2c72a177855","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\supseteq\\mathrm Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(x),\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(x)\\,\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\n\\psi\\leftrightarrow\n\\theta\\!\\left(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}\\right)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta(x)=\\theta(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(x,x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi=\\delta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\delta\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false}],"bytes":1495,"backlinks":[{"id":"719296019c11ec36","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5f78118711a12b83","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"54f6107246f40c19","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"567189f4b7e57f6f","anchor":"re